    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through an occult farm compound owned by a family who operates a gruesome hunting ground for unsuspecting travelers.\u00a0These captives face a nightmarish fate\u2014becoming test subjects for horrific experiments and sacrifices to the terrifying Blood Moon Serpent.\u00a0Face off against grotesque, mutilated monsters as you fight to uncover the truth in finding your missing wife and son in an adrenaline-pumping shooter\u00a0<i>Flesh Farm</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect flesh parts, relics, and items to unlock doors and the truth of your wife and son</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a labyrinth of claustrophobic terror\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve mind-bending environmental puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AXE check! CHAINSAW check! SHOTGUN check!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593260/extras/9540ab6548556b4135435fc27c366a57.poster.avif?t=1748932928\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593260/extras/9540ab6548556b4135435fc27c366a57.webm?t=1748932928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593260/extras/9540ab6548556b4135435fc27c366a57.mp4?t=1748932928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3593260/extras/64190890ca4c7133436f257979020a2c.poster.avif?t=1748932928\" width=608 height=174 ><source sr